@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
# Get these access tokens by signing in as the corresponding test user.
# Never paste a real token into a committed file. Use a private .http-local
# environment file or a REST client secret-variable store.
@lectorToken = REPLACE_WITH_READER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Reader can list messages; expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}

### Reader cannot delete, even by bypassing the UI; expected 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{lectorToken}}

### Administrator can delete; expected 200 with { "deleted": 1 }
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
